# App Store media is output, not source: ~200 MB of PNG and H.264 that git
# cannot compress and would keep for ever, and it is not byte-reproducible
# either (see AppStore/screenshots.md). Regenerate it with
# Tools/appstore_media.sh; App Store Connect keeps the record of what shipped.
